ot the way her mother want her to live.One day her mother made a date for Cansu and Mert. But the date failed so she went to a café and saw a woman reads the future. The woman told Cansu that she will love a poor man in a workplace. Cansu went to work in Olivia supermarket and met her new friend Ece (Meriç Aral). And also met Kerem. And everything will start there.","rating":{"sources":[],"value":0,"age":"N/A"},"current_season_id":9635,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}